## Why This Is Asked
Tests design for multi-tenant ML services with SLA adherence, privacy, and drift handling in a single-region, VPC-bound setup.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker Multi-Model Endpoints; per-tenant routing; fair-share scheduling
- QoS, concurrency, canary rollouts; drift detection and retraining cadence
- Data locality, PrivateLink, encryption, audit logging

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode showing tenant routing
function route(request){
  const tenant = request.tenantId;
  const model = loadTenantModelIfNeeded(tenant);
  return model.predict(request.features);
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests multi-tenant inference design, data isolation, cost accounting, and security controls in production ML workloads on AWS.

## Key Concepts
- PrivateLink and API Gateway for private, authenticated access.
- SageMaker Multi-Model Endpoint to share resources.
- Tenant-level quotas and encryption (KMS envelope keys).
- Canary releases, drift monitoring, cost attribution.

## Code Example
```javascript
function route(req){
  const payload = verifyJWT(req.headers.authorization);
  if(!payload.tenant_id) throw new Error('tenant required');
  // quota check…
  return forwardToEndpoint(payload.tenant_id, req.body);
}
```

